WEBVTT

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.080
Do you think Master is okay?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.210
He's been like this forever.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.960
I don't think he's that sensitive
to brood over a loss.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.720
I didn't know the King was that powerful.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.600
<i>Kikka is...</i>

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.810
She's his younger sister then.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.270
Master's.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.600
Seems like it.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:51.440
Do you think he'll give up on
challenging the King?

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.280
NO NEW MESSAGES

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.700
I didn't sign up for this.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.510
#05 Cake and Fishhook

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.130
Guilty.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.690
Guilty.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.410
Guilty.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.160
You are all guilty.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.120
Territory. Shrine of Justice. Activate ability.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.460
Bloom. You're an eyesore.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:19.670
Go away.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.720
Time for your punishment.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.440
Elizabelt, Angel of Law. Accept.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.360
Activate ability.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:39.150
Using her ability.
Relphy, Twin Angel of Punishment. Accept.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.910
Oh no you don't.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.880
No way am I allowing you to surrender.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.880
Elizabelt. Eliminate Riverwort.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.180
That just leaves you.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.510
Relphy.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.740
Launching Margreia.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.790
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.420
I said none of that.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.380
My final Judgment has already been made.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.760
Margreia.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.530
Oh...

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.740
Another round, perhaps?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.240
No.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.960
Playing with dolls is beyond boring.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.710
Oh boy. I'm so bored.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.170
I had so much fun with Teruto.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.760
I want to play with Teruto again.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.840
That's not going to happen.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.930
Why not? Stingy.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.720
I am worried about you, King.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.140
Not that again?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:39.270
Seeing how pale you are,
you mustn't push yourself so hard.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.110
I'm sure someone of his caliber will come around.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.860
Since you have become stronger.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:51.200
Do you really intend to face him again
in this state of exhaustion?

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.580
I get it already.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.790
I have to sleep, right?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.250
Thank you very much.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.250
Rinpu.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.820
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.200
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.700
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.870
<i>He was really there, right?</i>

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.620
<i>You can't.</i>

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.290
<i>Teruto...</i>

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.840
<i>Belongs only to me.</i>

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.890
About what happened the other day.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.560
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.400
Oh. Oops.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.230
Just what are you planning?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.070
Come on.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:12.870
Since somebody is taking forever
to show me some dreams...

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.240
I got so bored.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.120
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.580
It's not like I'm blaming you.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.250
Okay?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.710
Sit tight a little longer.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.550
Once that guy gets here,
everything will fall into place.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.300
A little longer, huh?

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:33.340
However, your interference
did throw me for a loop.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.550
Don't be like that.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.020
How do you know if I even got in your way or not?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:43.560
To have your wish granted,
wouldn't it be better for him to be strong?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:49.030
No big deal. I was just about to head out anyway.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.650
While I'm at it, I'll take care of him too.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.740
Aren't you going to ask where I'm going?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.450
Where are you going?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.790
Secret.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.330
Just kidding.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:08.250
I thought I'd go fishing since it was
my number one horoscope today.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.130
Nothing better to do.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.090
I should be able to catch a big one.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.050
See you. Taking the easy way out.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.110
Master!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.490
Please pull yourself together, Master.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.360
You can't sit around moping like that.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.280
You need to switch gears.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.780
We're going to look for challengers now.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.490
She's right.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:44.370
"No pleasure without pain,"
is what Grandpa Mito used to say.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.540
Never heard of it.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.130
Oh...

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.630
Master, you're so cold!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:54.130
More importantly,
I can't believe you don't know Grandpa Mito.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.510
You've really let me down. He's my favorite.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:01.350
Playing with fish won't catch you any chips.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.520
Don't tell me you actually
gave up on taking down the King?

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:13.440
Tell me, is the King really your little sister?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.950
Master.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.530
Hey, where are you going?

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.040
Leave me alone.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.670
Sakura.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.460
Seriously...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.460
Hiyori, can you come with me?

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.640
CAFE GION MITSUMU

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.100
Wow!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.720
I heard the cake here is delicious.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.100
I can eat this cake?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.310
Of course you can.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:51.400
I've never eaten such
expensive looking cake before.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.190
I'm treating you today.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.360
But in return,
you're having a strategy meeting with me.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:00.200
Are you sure? Wait, strategy meeting?

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:05.000
Right. We've got to figure out
how to get that moron back on his feet.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:33.940
This is...

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.730
Something I've always dreamed of.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.650
Strawberry shortcake.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.530
Seeing you so happy makes it
totally worth treating you.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:47.330
Oh my. Sakura, thank you so much!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.540
Sure. You can have mine too if you want.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.500
You mean it?

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.260
Today's stars are aligned for Pisces.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.360
So, Hiyori.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.360
Yes?

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:21.700
It's been bugging me for a while,
but don't you find Teruto kind of weird?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.120
Huh? Master?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:28.330
Well, he's a bit directionally challenged
and has an irrational love for bread.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.710
That too, but...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:36.090
Do you think the King is really Teruto's little sister?

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.420
Meaning it was actually a lie?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:42.180
Not sure if it's a lie,
but why didn't he know about it?

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:47.720
But Master said it very clearly,
that she was his little sister.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:53.690
When I first met Teruto,
he had forgotten all about Build-Divide.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:59.070
He had no status,
and knew nothing about Neo Kyoto.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:04.070
Also, the other day he said something
as bizarre as, "outside of Neo Kyoto."

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.700
Maybe he was just half-asleep.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.830
I mean, aside from when it comes to bread,
Master is always absent-minded.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.330
You're right.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.750
If that's the case, then if the King is really...

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:19.630
Then...

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:21.880
<i>Where is Teruto?</i>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.510
Is something the matter?

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:27.970
Huh?

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.850
Oh, sorry for asking such a strange question.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.600
Like you said,
he was probably just being absent-minded.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.650
That's got to be it.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.610
When you're done eating,
let's get started on our strategy meeting.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.280
Right.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.880
Isn't fishing great?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:05.380
Just dangling your line makes
all your worries seem so insignificant.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.890
Oh wait, I don't have any worries, do I?

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.230
You look like you're really brooding over something.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:18.940
Shut up.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.320
Hey, so you can talk then?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:29.370
Can I guess why you look so glum?

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.160
That would be...

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.080
Because you can't catch any fish, right?

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.830
From my experience...

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:43.920
There are two reasons why you can't catch anything.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.630
The first is hesitation.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.890
When you feel guilty about reeling in a fish.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.510
The other is...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.640
Well, it's fear.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:59.770
You lose confidence as to whether
or not you can reel in the big fish.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.780
If you lose a big catch,
you become consumed by this fear.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.950
Well, I guess you'd call it the trauma of defeat.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.870
The trauma of defeat.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.630
Looks like I might have hit the mark.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.800
Nothing like that.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.510
Again...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.060
I lost.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:15:00.540
Hm, how can we make Master feel better?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.040
This might be the only way.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.380
What is it?

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.590
We'll reveal Teruto's location online.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.970
So that challengers will target him.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.810
What? With Master in such a fragile state,
that would be dangerous!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.390
I'm fully aware of the risk.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:26.030
The only way to regain the confidence
he lost is through Build-Divide.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.400
But...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:32.700
For better or worse,
that gambler is sure to bet all of his chips.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.700
If we leak that information,
the challengers should come swarming in.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.620
But what if he loses?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.410
He'll immediately lose his right to challenge.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.040
This is a gamble.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.590
We can't have him in a rut at a time like this.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.670
Not after I've gone all in on Teruto.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:53.640
MUST SEE! FOR CHALLENGERS BETTING CHIPS
YOUR CHANCE TO WIN EIGHT CHIPS!

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.020
It's swirling, huh?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.690
Fear. Confusion. Desperation.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.070
Also...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.320
Hatred.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:22.080
I win. Let's play again. Okay?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.170
All right, I win.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.420
One more game.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.800
One more game.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:29.800
One more game.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.050
This is so much fun.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.470
Teruto, you really are...

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.850
That's why I enjoy it so much.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:51.110
She was the one player I could never beat.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:55.200
Why don't you challenge her one more time?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.660
No matter what it's always the same.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.910
I lost to her again.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.410
Why are you being such a pushover?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.380
Don't run away from defeat.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:09.750
You're wrong. I—

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.800
You're so intoxicated by your own weakness.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.760
But she's gotten even stronger.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.140
If you drown in weakness, you'll die.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:17.890
Die?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.850
Are you just going to die meekly?

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.470
I...

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.430
Why do you battle?

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:24.940
Because...

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.270
To win, right?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.610
So you can be better than everyone else, right?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.280
Better than everyone else.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.820
That's right. Better than the King.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.110
Better than Kikka.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.780
Right. Better!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:37.950
Better.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:43.950
Battle. Fight back. Bring her down!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.210
Defeat her.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.840
That's right. I...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.260
I'm going to defeat the King. Kikka.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.800
Right. That's how it should be.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.140
Well, guess I'll be taking off now.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.520
You sure can't catch anything to save your life.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.610
Are you sure there's a hook on that line?

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.530
All good.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.780
You can't let a minnow get away
when you're young.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.040
All right, give it all you've got, young man.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.790
I've exchanged the hook.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:32.290
Come on, show me a good time.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.760
Do you think some challengers are there?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.230
Master is okay, right?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.850
We can only hope.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.400
Master.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.280
What's this?

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:03.530
Hey, don't tell me you've just
been fishing here the whole time?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.040
I've really had it with you.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.550
Worrying about you was a waste of time.

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:16.380
That was my dinner.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.550
You...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.260
What's your problem?

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.970
Both of you, stop it.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.560
Master, didn't any challengers show up?

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.520
Challengers?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.480
Yes. I lured them here.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.150
So it was you two?

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.190
Sending over small fry.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.520
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.900
Eleven chips.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.660
Three more than before.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.330
Master, you've come back to life.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.830
I was never dead in the first place.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.370
Master!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:52.170
You really seemed to brood over
that battle the other day.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.880
I would never lose sight of my path.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.460
I will defeat the King.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.970
Promise us.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.390
I've gone all in on you, Teruto.

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.180
Sure.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:09.520
Wow! That's my Master.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:12.810
I'll follow you to the ends of the earth, Master.

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.730
Shut up. You're expelled.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.570
What? Why?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:21.400
Earlier, you said I was cold
and that I'd let you down.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.110
You were listening?

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:28.330
I didn't mean it. It just slipped out.
It was just gibberish. Um, um...

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.160
I'm so sorry.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:34.580
Master, say something please.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.610
Ishinome.

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.320
Well. So you're up already?

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:29.780
What did you bring me?

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:30.700
Huh?

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.330
I heard from Higuma that you went fishing.

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:37.040
Oh. I'm sorry, I don't have anything for you.

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:40.170
What? You didn't catch anything?

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:43.500
No, I did manage to catch a big one.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:44.960
But I let it go.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.430
Hey, I was looking forward to it.

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.930
Sorry about that! But what were
you planning to do with a fish?

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:55.390
Grill it with salt.

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:00.310
All right. Then I'll be sure
to bring you something next time.

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:02.690
Hey. You have to promise me, okay?

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.820
I know. Tell me your astrological sign.

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.150
You can read your horoscope here.

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:12.870
Astrological sign? Let's see.
What was today's again?

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:14.870
My bad. I don't remember.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:18.410
What? Boo.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.130
I'll decide after I check
my horoscope tomorrow morning.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:26.130
What's that supposed to mean? So weird.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.970
TO BE CONTINUED

